{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55661","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十九 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世途从此免相关，万虑潜消野思闲。\n庵树逼春花自吐，岩巢欲暮鸟空还。\n门前雾闭疑无路，槛外云开忽有山。\n宴坐石岩樵径绝，姓名应不到人间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55661.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55661","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}